[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818067526","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105606#issuecomment-2818067526","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105606","id":2818067526,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n-ExG","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T09:51:21Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T09:51:42Z","body":"I personally feel like the extent in which this PR goes to customize debug drawing is quite excessive. Especially the custom sampling. It looks like something that the editor could infer automatically based on current performance, distance from the curve, overall length, and so on.\r\n\r\nDoes this PR happen to also supersede https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90357 ?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818067526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818207621","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105606#issuecomment-2818207621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105606","id":2818207621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n-m-F","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T11:17:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T12:54:52Z","body":"@Mickeon\r\n\r\n> Does this PR happen to also supersede 90357 ?\r\n\r\nWhile there is a little crossover the linked PR for the most part changes the actual Curve resources and their baked function and point sampling, something that this PR does not touch.\r\n\r\n> I personally feel like the extent in which this PR goes to customize debug drawing is quite excessive. Especially the custom sampling. It looks like something that the editor could infer automatically based on current performance, distance from the curve, overall length, and so on.\r\n\r\nThe editor can not infer this as long as it is not living in the users head. This is not about performance only but also user intention, so it needs settings.\r\n\r\nE.g. multiple times different people tried to convince me that a few more fish bones, a few less bones, or even so many fish bones that you can not spot the line anymore would be good and appropriated (the older PRs that reduced it to a hard-coded 4 interval had this discussions as well). Then we had people that said they needed the detail for only some important paths, and wanted all the less important to be coarse. Some said they did not care at all and wanted it off ... oh, and only for some paths btw.\r\n\r\nWith such vastly different views and uses among just a handful of people how would you automate this? it is not possible.\r\n\r\nFor improving performance there are also a lot of things still untapped, some I mentioned in the todo. The gizmo classes in general are highly inefficient the more complex the object is as they throw everything away and start from scratch on any change that causes a redraw even if just a minor change. They have like zero update granularity.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818207621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818376404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105606#issuecomment-2818376404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105606","id":2818376404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n_QLU","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T13:07:49Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T13:07:49Z","body":"Can the curve sampling be automatically determined based on whether the current/previous/next points use any curve tangents? If it's a straight line, it can be drawn with a single vertex. This would also optimize line drawing for lines that only have some curved points (but not all).\r\n\r\nAlso, I think **Custom Color** should be moved at the top of the custom options (below **Custom Enabled**) as it's likely the one users will tweak the most.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818376404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818467368","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105606#issuecomment-2818467368","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105606","id":2818467368,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n_mYo","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T14:00:54Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T14:03:08Z","body":"> Can the curve sampling be automatically determined based on whether the current/previous/next points use any curve tangents? \r\n\r\nYes oc you can preprocess everything but always the question if you gain more than you lose. This info if a segment is straight or curved should likely be part of the actual Curve resource point meta cache and not of the Path2D/3D Node as you don't want to recalculated it again for every single node that uses the curve.\r\n\r\n> Also, I think Custom Color should be moved at the top of the custom options (below Custom Enabled) as it's likely the one users will tweak the most.\r\n\r\nAgree, moved the `debug_custom_color` below the `debug_custom_enabled` in the property list.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818467368/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820805139","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105606#issuecomment-2820805139","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105606","id":2820805139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oIhIT","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T09:57:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T09:57:01Z","body":"Removed most of the customization options and functions on the nodes except color and the toggle for runtime debug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820805139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849409273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105606#issuecomment-2849409273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105606","id":2849409273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p1oj5","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/